OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Obsessive' Billie Piper stalker
OL,4,Ajailed for 12 months
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe court heard police carried out an
OL,7,Finspection of his devices on 27
OL,8,FDecember, finding four images of Piper
OL,9,Fsaved on his phone, and that he had
OL,10,Ftagged 11 posts and images on X
OL,11,Frelating to her on four days that
OL,12,Fmonth.
OL,14,FDefence lawyer Caroline Bonavia said he
OL,15,Fhad had a recent autism diagnosis and
OL,16,Fhad sought psychological support over
OL,17,F"obsessive" relationships.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
